<title>USA: Bullock Cty Sch Dist, Ga., yields 5.60 pct in 2017.</title>
<headline>Bullock Cty Sch Dist, Ga., yields 5.60 pct in 2017.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>SunTrust Capital Markets, Inc said it tentatively priced $10 million of Bullock County School District, Ga., general obligation bonds, Series 1997, with a top yield of 5.60 percent in 2017.</p>
